      <levelledPara id="par-000018-01">
        <title>Purpose</title>
        <para>This publication gives the description, technical data and maintenance procedures for the PDU-200 power distribution unit installed in the radar cabinet.</para>
      </levelledPara>
      <levelledPara id="par-000018-02">
        <title>Scope</title>
        <para>The publication covers organizational level maintenance. It contains:
          <randomList>
            <listItem><para>A description of the unit and how it works.</para></listItem>
            <listItem><para>The technical data for the unit.</para></listItem>
            <listItem><para>Test, inspection, remove and install procedures for the power supply modules.</para></listItem>
          </randomList>
        </para>
      </levelledPara>
      <levelledPara id="par-000018-03">
        <title>How to use this publication</title>
        <para>Read the general warnings and cautions in
